            "text": "{\n  \"posts\": [\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/NatGeoTravel/status/2082904065017590139\",\n      \"text\": \"What\u2019s one historical place you\u2019ve visited that made the past feel real?\\n\\nExplore ancient Pompeii and Herculaneum in #PompeiiOutOfTime with Tom Hiddleston. Now streaming on @DisneyPlus and @Hulu.\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"NatGeoTravel\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T19:00:02Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/NatlParkService/status/2083214677291696596\",\n      \"text\": \"On World Ranger Day, we celebrate the dedication, courage, and commitment of rangers who protect and care for national parks and protected areas around the world.\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"NatlParkService\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-31T15:34:17Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/NASA/status/2082911174522257413\",\n      \"text\": \"Astronaut Deniz Burnham is heading to space for the first time!\\n\\n@astro_deniz, a former NASA intern, will lift off to the @Space_Station next spring aboard the Roscosmos Soyuz MS-30 spacecraft: https://www.nasa.gov/news-release/nasa-assigns-astronaut-deniz-burnham-to-first-space-station-mission/?utm_source=TWITTER&utm_medium=NASA&utm_campaign=NASASocial&linkId=987875312\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"NASA\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T19:28:17Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/YellowstoneNPS/status/2082907615332274428\",\n      \"text\": \"Pikas may be small, but they sure are mighty! They are one of few mammal species in the Lower 48 that can survive their entire lives above tree line in high-alpine, rocky terrain.\\n\\nThough they look like rodents, they're actually more closely related to rabbits and hares and only eat plants. In late summer, you might see them working diligently to gather mouthfuls of vegetation to sustain them through winter.\\n\\nListen for their distinct high-pitched calls - one of the most recognizable indicators of active pika habitat!\\n\\nNPS Photo / Jacob W. Frank\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"YellowstoneNPS\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-30T19:14:08Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/NASAHubble/status/2082194383063875634\",\n      \"text\": \"These galaxies are locked in.\\n\\nThe pair, known as ESO 550-2, is caught in a gravitational dance.\\n\\nThis interaction's already deformed one arm of the larger galaxy on the left, though star formation continues in it. Learn more: https://science.nasa.gov/asset/hubble/hubble-interacting-galaxy-eso-550-2/?utm_source=TWITTER&utm_medium=NASAHubble&utm_campaign=NASASocial&linkId=984737111\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"NASAHubble\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-28T20:00:00Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/AMAZlNGNATURE/status/2083651229813764516\",\n      \"text\": \"This flower turns transparent when it rains\\n\\nKnown as the Skeleton Flower, its white petals become almost clear when wet before turning white again as they dry\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"AMAZlNGNATURE\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-01T20:29:00Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/Space_Station/status/2083591796332921314\",\n      \"text\": \".@NASA astronaut Deniz Burnham is targeted to begin her first mission to the International Space Station, serving as an Expedition 76 flight engineer, in March 2027. More... https://www.nasa.gov/news-release/nasa-assigns-astronaut-deniz-burnham-to-first-space-station-mission/\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"Space_Station\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-01T16:32:50Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/NASAEarth/status/2083245767687323925\",\n      \"text\": \"Extremely hot and dry conditions in June and July enabled large fires to break out in Europe.\\n\\nSpain saw its largest fire on record in \u00c1vila, as shown in this Landsat 9 false color image. Unburned vegetation is light green and burned areas appear brown. https://science.nasa.gov/earth/earth-observatory/destructive-fires-char-western-europe/?utm_source=TWITTER&utm_medium=NASAEarth&utm_campaign=NASASocial&linkId=988136389\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"NASAEarth\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-31T17:37:50Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/YellowstoneNPS/status/2081452051188371899\",\n      \"text\": \"Step aside wolves, bison, bears, and geysers! Sometimes it's nice to slow down and notice the little things.\\n\\nPhotos (NPS / Jacob W. Frank and Neal Herbert):\\n1. Red squirrel hiding in a snag\\n2. Painted lady resting in the sun\\n3. Raindrops\\n4. Bison tracks in a bacterial mat\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"YellowstoneNPS\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-26T18:50:15Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/NASAHubble/status/2080654232886116631\",\n      \"text\": \"A one-sided spiral \ud83c\udf00\\n\\nLocated about 72 million light-years away, the spiral galaxy NGC 4654 belongs to the Virgo Cluster of galaxies.\\n\\nIts asymmetric shape is caused by pressure it encounters as the galaxy moves through gas in its cluster: https://science.nasa.gov/missions/hubble/hubble-spies-one-sided-spiral/?utm_source=TWITTER&utm_medium=NASAHubble&utm_campaign=NASASocial&linkId=984738482\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"NASAHubble\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-24T14:00:00Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/AMAZlNGNATURE/status/2083682938735009817\",\n      \"text\": \"This bird has been known to chase eagles out of the sky\\n\\nRavens often harass much larger birds of prey until they decide it's not worth the trouble\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"AMAZlNGNATURE\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-08-01T22:35:00Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    },\n    {\n      \"source_url\": \"https://x.com/NatlParkService/status/2073377410620219590\",\n      \"text\": \"Happy Independence Day \ud83c\uddfa\ud83c\uddf8 \\n\\nFrom battlefields and memorials to parks and protected landscapes, the places cared for by the National Park Service help bring our shared history to life.\",\n      \"author_handle\": \"NatlParkService\",\n      \"created_at\": \"2026-07-04T12:04:30Z\",\n      \"has_media\": true\n    }\n  ]\n}",
            "type": "output_text"
          }
        ],
